  "step_2": "The individual states: 'Alle Felder aufgedeckt. Bei Lotterie B hätte man verlieren können, daher den sicheren Gewinn bei Lotterie A gewählt.' This translates to: 'All fields revealed. In Lottery B, one could have lost, therefore chose the safe win in Lottery A.' The individual considers the risk of loss in Lottery B (i.e., the possibility of losing 3000 Euros) and contrasts it with the certainty of gaining 1000 Euros in Lottery A. The focus is on the potential loss in Lottery B and the safety of Lottery A. There is no mention of the difference between the maximum and minimum outcomes or the spread of outcomes. The justification is based on risk aversion and certainty, not on the difference between max and min values.",
